\section{Conclusion}
The coastline is complex, perhaps infinitely so \citep{Mandelbrot1982}. We introduce a means to generate and query high precision coastal data. If even higher precision is desired, this method should scale favorably up to the maximum resolution of commercial satellite imagery (10 cm as of June 2025). Not everyone needs high-resolution coastal data, but for those who do, we have open sourced both our dataset and method under permissive licenses. 
