Sections~\ref{sec:conv_rel}~-~\ref{sec:Algo} are devoted, respectively, to the applications relating to quantifying the conservativeness of inner approximations and data-driven estimation of Pareto optimal solutions. Numerical illustrations are provided shortly after the key results to quantitatively complement their understanding.  Proofs are furnished in the appendix.



