An immediate implication of Theorem \ref{lem:Wasserstein_CCP} is that the decisions prescribed by Wasserstein DRO formulations are exponentially more expensive than its non-robust counterpart when $\Prob$ is light-tailed and polynomially more expensive when $\Prob$ is heavy-tailed. 
