Theorem \ref{lem:moment_ambiguity} below provides a lower bound of the cost of an optimal decision prescribed by mean-dispersion based DRO formulations. For uniformity in notation, take $p = 2$ if $d = d_{cov}.$

\begin{theorem}[\textbf{Conservativeness of moment based DRO}]
\label{lem:moment_ambiguity}
