Lemmas~\ref{lem:compact_containment} and \ref{lem:extended_functional} now imply that $\{O_\alpha:\alpha>0\}$ satisfy the conditions of \cite{bonnans2013perturbation}, Proposition 4.4 (see the discussion below Proposition 4.6 therein), with the limiting function
