In this work, we investigate 18 different pre-trained models to translate 400 brain MRI images to CT images and vice versa. The goal of the study was to explore the ability of these models to perform image translation between different modalities and generate images that are comparable to real images. Models are chosen to be comprehensive and based on their performance in previous studies.

